WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Search names, SKUs and slugs
Use the list search and filters to find the right product. Open its name
to inspect the record before editing.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Check the product and its state
The product name, type and status identify the offer. Edit is available
only with the required permission. Saving a record is different from
publishing it.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Review variants and related content
Variants, images and categories have separate tabs. A cart buys a
variant, so review the actual option, its price and stock rather than
just the parent product.

